#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Draft a theme directory from a wallpaper or a Base16 scheme.

Authoring helper only — does not replace theme-switcher.sh. Output is a
starting point under ~/.dotfiles/themes/<slug>/ that you hand-tune before
relying on it.

Subcommands:
  wallpaper <image> [--name SLUG] [--icon EMOJI] [--force]
  base16 <name|file|url> [--name SLUG] [--icon EMOJI] [--force]
"""

